e__text | color-white\">+1 650 800 5539</span>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <!-- <div class=\"footer__phone phone\" fxLayoutAlign=\"center end\">\r\n                    <img class=\"phone__icon\" src=\"../../assets/img/icons/phone-icon.svg\" alt=\"Telefono: (+52) 554 170 4129\">\r\n                    <span class=\"phone__text | color-white\">(+52) 554 170 4129</span>\r\n                </div> -->\r\n                <div class=\"footer__version version\">\r\n                    <span class=\"version__text | color-white\">v2.11.20.21.135</span>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </footer>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Loading -->\r\n<app-loading *ngIf=\"showLoad\"></app-loading>\r\n");

