to').touched)\" class=\"alert__text | color-red\" translate>Esta persona no puede ser menor de edad</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"btnabajo\" fxFlex=\"98\" fxLayout=\"row wrap\" fxLayoutAlign=\"end end\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ml-3\" fxLayoutAlign=\"end end\">\r\n                        <button class=\"regresar__button | \" type=\"button\" [routerLink]=\"['/administrador/cuentaeje/personal-administrativo/lista-personal-administrativo']\" routerLinkActive=\"active\">Regresar</button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ml-3\" fxLayoutAlign=\"end end\">\r\n                        <button class=\"confirmar__button | color-white\" type=\"button\" id=\"submit\" type=\"submit\">Guardar</button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </form>\r\n\r\n</div>");

